  "description": "A .NET Standard 2.0 and .NET 10 bundle of the core nventive Uno.Core.Extensions helper libraries (general extensions, collections, disposables, equality, logging, and threading), namespace-renamed into CodeBrix.Platform.Extensions.* for use by CodeBrix.Platform and its consumers. Multi-targets netstandard2.0 (e.g. for Roslyn source generators) and net10.0. Vendors the source of Uno.Core.Extensions, .Collections, .Disposables, .Equality, .Logging, .Logging.Singleton, and .Threading at version 4.1.1.",
